## `Lexer.php`
- Graham Campbell holds 48 of 48 lines (100%) and has made 7 commits. The first was on 2020-06-07 and the last on 2026-08-24. He is marked active.
- No one else has changed the file.
- 15 of the 48 lines (31.3%) were moved or copied in from other paths: `src/Loader/Lines.php`, `src/Lines.php` and `src/Loader/Value.php`. The credit goes to whoever wrote them there, not to whoever moved them. The tool did not name those original authors. For questions about that older code, check blame on those source paths.
